🖥️ Screen-by-Screen Implementation Overview
Screen 1: Find Parking (Search & Discovery)
Official Branding & Value Proposition: SpotZa official 3D location-pin icon, brand title, and clear introduction explaining upfront price transparency and safety verification.
Destination Input: Search bar pre-filled with "City Center Commercial Hub", with 1-click popular preset chips (City Center, Metro Terminal, Shopping Plaza, Financial District).
Vehicle Type Toggle: Segmented selector for Car (4-Wheeler) vs. Bike (Two-Wheeler). Switching dynamically recalibrates the budget range and baseline tariffs.
Maximum Hourly Budget Selector: Real-time interactive slider in Indian Rupees (₹) (₹20/hr to ₹100/hr) with quick preset buttons (₹20, ₹40, ₹60, ₹80).
Primary CTA: Deep plum button ("Find Available Parking Spaces") navigating smoothly to Screen 2.
Value Trust Cards: Three trust pillars highlighting zero pricing surprises, verified physical security, and proximity.
Screen 2: Compare Parking (Comparative Intelligence)
Active Search Context Strip: Displays destination, vehicle type, and budget limit with a 1-click "Edit Search" button.
4 Realistic Generic Parking Facilities:
Central Multi-Level Parking Deck: ₹40/hr, 0.25 km (3 min walk), 38/160 spots open, 32 HD CCTV, 24/7 Security Guard. (Tag: Closest Walk)
Metro Junction Safe Vault Lot: ₹30/hr, 0.45 km (6 min walk), 84/220 spots open, Underground, 2-Shift Guard. (Tag: Best Value)
City Plaza Underground Garage: ₹60/hr, 0.65 km (8 min walk), 112/300 spots open, Valet, 64 AI Cams, 24/7 Agency. (Tag: High Security)
District Market Open Secure Yard: ₹20/hr, 0.85 km (11 min walk), 14/90 spots open, Gated, Day Attendant. (Tag: Budget Pick)
Multi-Factor Sorting: Instant re-ordering by Price (Lowest First), Distance (Closest First), Availability (Most Spaces), or Rating.
Quick Filter Chips: Instant toggles for All Lots, Within Budget, CCTV Monitored, and 24/7 Security Guard.
Side-by-Side Comparison Matrix: Dedicated modal table comparing all 4 facilities side-by-side across tariffs, distance, walk times, capacity, CCTV, security guards, and shelter type.
Screen 3: Parking Details & Cost Calculator
Facility Profile & Verification: Full address, landmark info, star rating, and a 4-box key metric grid (Hourly Rate, Distance, Available Spaces, Total Capacity).
Security Deep Dive: Verified 24/7 CCTV surveillance specs and on-duty physical guard schedule.
Facility Amenities: Covered parking, EV fast charging, wheelchair ramp, automated boom barrier, high illumination, and vehicle height clearances.
Interactive Estimated Cost Calculator:
Interactive duration slider (1 to 12 hours) + quick select chips (1h, 2h, 3h, 5h, 8h, 12h).
Dynamic mathematical formula: Hourly Rate (₹) × Selected Duration = Estimated Total (₹).
Transparent subtotal, prototype fee waiver (₹0), and budget comparison indicator showing exact savings against your allocated budget.
Prototype Demo Actions:
"Check Availability" button triggering simulated sensor refresh with live timestamp confirmation.
"Select This Parking Spot" opening a demo SpotZa FastPass voucher with simulated QR code and bay allocation guidance.
